      "content": "i feel like im just running on a treadmill that’s going way too fast and i’m barely holding on. every cent i make just goes straight back into rent and debt and groceries. it feels like i’m literally working just to afford the right to keep working. like there's no actual point to any of it, just a cycle of exhaustion that never actually ends.",
