    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't see how \"small acts\" change the math though. the numbers stay the same. the debt stays the same. it’s like trying to empty the ocean with a spoon. i'm just tired of fighting an inevitable outcome. if the system is designed to just keep grinding people down until they're empty, then maybe the only way to actually stop the grind is to just... stop. it feels like the only logical exit from a game that was rigged from the start.",
